<title>USA: Air Express /Digital in Pac Rim pact.</title>
<headline>Air Express /Digital in Pac Rim pact.</headline>
<dateline>DARIEN, Connecticut 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Express International (AEI) said it has reached agreement with the systems business unit of Digital Equipment Corp to manage its Asia Pacific logistics for customized computer solutions for government and businesses.</p>
<p>AEI said that as a consequence of their alliance, Digital has streamlined its Pacific Rim warehouse network, closing several facilities and consolidating all inventory at AEI's Singapore distribution centre.</p>
<p>AEI said DEC also is increasing its Asia computer production through a program to build computers in Singapore. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
